Password/TOTP relogin
----------------------

The optional relogin module is adapted from pay153-local:

  backend/relogin_auth.py
  backend/chatgpt_login_st.py
  backend/registration_fingerprint.py

It vendors a minimal Python-only copy of tokenrefresh 1.1.0 under
src/st2at/_vendor/tokenrefresh. The vendored copy keeps its original module
names and is loaded only when st2at.login is used.
